note How this repository moves to a new omega-mv pin, read by the landing tools' pin-follow.sh when omega-mv
note lands a new seed/out/omc. PIN stays the only place the pin is written; the follower rewrites PIN, runs
note tools/regen.sh (which needs omega-mcp's reference data for the same pin, hence the follows line), commits,
note and lands only when examples/gate.sh and tools/check.sh pass on a fresh clone ("Keeping it current").
follows rad:z3e8UBQVfwEcESJrcTWEbyMAHWFBZ
regen sh tools/regen.sh "$OMC"
gate examples bash examples/gate.sh "$OMC"
gate check sh tools/check.sh "$OMC"
install mkdir -p "$HOME/.local/state/omega-harness" && flock "$HOME/.local/state/omega-harness/install.lock" sh tools/install.sh --omc auto --rev "$PF_HEAD"
